        "message": "feat(PR-N1): local tick CPU and framed-byte measurement\n\nA0005's last deferral is closed. The harness runs the server's own\nstepWorld -> hashWorld -> snapshot encode path for 180 ticks with 64 entities,\ndiscarding 20 warmup ticks, and reports local CPU p50 0.1625 ms / p95 0.2109 ms\nplus a 1551-byte full snapshot = 46530 B/s = 3.79x the 12 KB/s budget.\n\nIt is explicitly NOT network RTT and NOT a 30-minute soak; a second local run\ngave p95 0.761 ms, so CPU timings are labelled noisy. server_tick_p95_ms in\nmetrics stays NOT COMPUTABLE — a local CPU number must not be sold as a\nnetwork-load result. Byte figures are exact.\n\nThe blueprint acc 'pnpm sim prn1 --assert' could never run (no sim script);\nrepaired to the vitest command that executes the harness. Eighth distinct\nbroken acc form found; 7 pnpm test --filter forms remain.\n\nAcceptance: harness 3/3, full 125/125, verify 17/17, blueprint 0.\n\nAgent: qa-engineer\nTask: PR-N1",
